[
    {
        "content": "<p>Hey, </p>\n<p>i'm currently doing a Lean course for my studies. I'm having problems understand elim and intro rules in more complicated scenarios. To be more concrete in the following case, the goal is to extract 'p x' so I use And.left to get the left part of the and term. The And.left Term states ?a ∧ ?b → ?a, so in my understanding using And.left on pxaqx yields (∀x, p x). How do I get from '(∀x, p x)' to 'p x' and why do I need the 'x' behind pxaqx? </p>\n<p>Term (Second part of an Iff.intro): <br>\n     /-⊢ ((∀ (x : α), p x) ∧ ∀ (x : α), q x) → ∀ (x : α), p x ∧ q x-/<br>\n    (assume pxaqx : (∀x, p x) ∧ (∀x, q x)<br>\n     fix x : α<br>\n     have px : p x :=<br>\n      And.left pxaqx x<br>\n     have qx : q x :=<br>\n      And.right pxaqx x<br>\n     And.intro px qx)</p>",
        "id": 615847017,
        "sender_full_name": "Marco Krumpholz",
        "timestamp": 1786453439
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Welcome! It will help if you post a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mwe.html\">#mwe</a> and format your code with backticks so that it renders nicely. I think the answer to your question is that, <code>And.left pxaqx : ∀x, p x</code> indeed, and <code>∀x, p x</code> is just notation for <code>(x : α) → p x</code>, a function type. So <code>(And.left pxaqx) x</code> is just applying this function to the argument <code>x</code>, which is just deductive reasoning. Deductive reasoning is the (only) way you get from <code>∀x, p x</code> to <code>p a</code> for some concrete <code>a</code>.</p>",
        "id": 615850970,
        "sender_full_name": "Jeremy Chen",
        "timestamp": 1786454526
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>mwe:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Iff</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pxaqx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">px</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">And</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pxaqx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">qx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">And</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pxaqx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">And</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">px</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">qx</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
